Revision history for JSON-Schema-Corvus-XS

v0.1.1  2026-11-06
  - Built with Alien::CorvusJsonSchema v0.1.2, on C library 0.1.7 or later: a leap second is a valid date-time
    only on the 27 days that ended with one (23:59:60 UTC). The test suite runs the JSON-Schema-Test-Suite's
    leap-second cases, which it skipped.

v0.1.0  2026-10-20
  - First release: JSON Schema validation (draft 4, 6, 7, 2019-09 and 2020-12) on the corvus-json-schema C library
    (0.1.4 or later in the 0.1 series), which Alien::CorvusJsonSchema finds or installs. Validates JSON text, Perl
    data and parsed documents; results at the basic, detailed and verbose levels, with annotations; custom formats, a
    document resolver, and a limit of time on each match of a regular expression.
